{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_8104B4BB","title":"Ask Rosetta for Help with Records","entry":"Dlg_8104B4BB::entry","exit":"Dlg_8104B4BB::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_2CB3B7E5","articyId":"72057821671264168","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"Hello again! I am so happy to see you!","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hello again! I am so happy to see you!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":100.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35290","byteOffset":25711416,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_D03A16E0","articyId":"72057821671264174","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"In all honestly, we rarely get visitors for holograms that are older than 10 years.","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"In all honestly, we rarely get visitors for holograms that are older than 10 years.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40964","byteOffset":29825088,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_B7E1026A","articyId":"72057821671264180","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"You! You are not allowed to be here!","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You! You are not allowed to be here!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":100.0,"y":925.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22934","byteOffset":16560208,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_0119B6A3","articyId":"72057821671264186","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"Perhaps. People tell them all sorts of secrets. Coma Roamers and LifeCorp secrets... they just might know something, and they never stop talking. They have no filter.","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Perhaps. People tell them all sorts of secrets. Coma Roamers and LifeCorp secrets... they just might know something, and they never stop talking. They have no filter.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3400.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43742","byteOffset":30878896,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_03DA74B7","articyId":"72057821671264204","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"Coma-roamers? There are no records here about that programme! No such programme ever existed. You shouldn't even ask for it.","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Coma-roamers? There are no records here about that programme! No such programme ever existed. You shouldn't even ask for it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44440","byteOffset":31141992,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_66593F98","articyId":"72057821671264238","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"You are welcome! Here is a tissue!","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You are welcome! Here is a tissue!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4300.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46047","byteOffset":31751320,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_F1665196","articyId":"72057821671264244","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"The TheraPay boys! Those old buckets have been around a long time, and they hold more secrets than people realize. You'll need to find an old one.","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The TheraPay boys! Those old buckets have been around a long time, and they hold more secrets than people realize. You'll need to find an old one.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2800.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46094","byteOffset":31769208,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_85C2FAEB","articyId":"72057821671264250","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"You are not allowed to look for records!","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You are not allowed to look for records!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":925.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16915","byteOffset":14289592,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_15C8966C","articyId":"72057821671264262","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"CORA no! What a question! If it was allowed, I would be aghast right now. Aghast! If you do not have an expired human relative to visit, you should NOT be here!","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"CORA no! What a question! If it was allowed, I would be aghast right now. Aghast! If you do not have an expired human relative to visit, you should NOT be here!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":925.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36542","byteOffset":28169328,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_CD957CCE","articyId":"72057821671264278","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"If I was allowed to, I would tell you to go jump in the sea!","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If I was allowed to, I would tell you to go jump in the sea!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2525.0,"y":1125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26165","byteOffset":17780168,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_E29FEFBF","articyId":"72057821671269457","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"No. And I think I know what you need, but I don't have it. Perhaps I can point you in the right direction though... Some of the boys might have a long memory.","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No. And I think I know what you need, but I don't have it. Perhaps I can point you in the right direction though... Some of the boys might have a long memory.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2200.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47787","byteOffset":32413040,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_D128F0EF","articyId":"72057606922881090","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"If I was allowed, to I would tell you to leave now!","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If I was allowed, to I would tell you to leave now!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2525.0,"y":900.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24812","byteOffset":17267104,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_27976609","articyId":"72057821671304258","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"But instead I will recommend you see a TheraPay bot. Old frozen bodies... Coma Roamers...","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But instead I will recommend you see a TheraPay bot. Old frozen bodies... Coma Roamers...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2825.0,"y":900.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38045","byteOffset":28728280,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_2277A1D5","articyId":"72057834556101946","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"All sensitive data, but those old buckets have been around a long time, and they hold more secrets than people realize. You'll need to find an old one.","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"All sensitive data, but those old buckets have been around a long time, and they hold more secrets than people realize. You'll need to find an old one.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3125.0,"y":900.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38193","byteOffset":28783328,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_FFDB7C12","articyId":"72057834556101953","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"And even if they can't help you with your bizarre requests, they can help you talk though your obvious mental and emotional issues.","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And even if they can't help you with your bizarre requests, they can help you talk though your obvious mental and emotional issues.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3425.0,"y":900.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42565","byteOffset":30430928,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_93C473CA","articyId":"72057821671264151","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Rosetta","text":"No. Holograms only last 99 years here. After that we delete them to make space on our servers. And we don't store biological material. No bodies!","speakerId":"Ntt_287C6C75","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No. Holograms only last 99 years here. After that we delete them to make space on our servers. And we don't store biological material. No bodies!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42727","byteOffset":30493256,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_EF546578","articyId":"72057821671264157","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Thanks Rosetta.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thanks Rosetta.","TextSheVersion":"Thanks Rosetta.","TextTheyVersion":"Thanks Rosetta."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3700.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26800","byteOffset":18018304,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_F74589A8","articyId":"72057821671264192","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm looking for records about coma-roamers in the Holocropolis.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm looking for records about coma-roamers in the Holocropolis.","TextSheVersion":"I'm looking for records about coma-roamers in the Holocropolis.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm looking for records about coma-roamers in the Holocropolis."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":400.0,"y":675.0},"sourc